                                            "A hypothetical higher-dimensional space within which our own four-dimensional universe may exist."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ffb0c088-f0b7-37fe-aad3-b004018ef863",
                                        "entry_id": "493e9b77-6a94-3b6e-9682-ce823d1d325b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The body."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "obsolete",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e698fefb-2b68-4213-b1c8-e6a444518cf5",
                                                "sense_id": "ffb0c088-f0b7-37fe-aad3-b004018ef863",
                                                "text": "...haunted the chocolate-houses, beat the watch, lay on bulks, and got claps;"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c11758b8-df86-4341-831d-29ae2f4ef7b4",
                                                "sense_id": "ffb0c088-f0b7-37fe-aad3-b004018ef863",
                                                "text": "Methought I had, and often did I strive\nTo yield the ghost, but still the envious flood\nStopped in my soul and would not let it forth\nTo find the empty, vast, and wand'ring air,\nBut smothered it within my panting bulk,\nWho almost burst to belch it in the sea."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "dc49065d-39cb-4bc2-8f57-6586e5caacc3",
                                                "sense_id": "ffb0c088-f0b7-37fe-aad3-b004018ef863",
                                                "text": "little Cupide stroue\nWithin her bulke, because that she had woue\nThe web that wrought Nastagio all his woe"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
