                                                "sense_id": "af399044-d603-31e5-b7b1-c6d3bec1e265",
                                                "text": "The fame of Warburton possibly bulked larger for the moment."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7e333463-d10c-4776-8f62-4755e44c9cec",
                                                "sense_id": "af399044-d603-31e5-b7b1-c6d3bec1e265",
                                                "text": "Last, behold on Juss’s right hand, yon lord that bulks mighty as Hercules yet steppeth lightly as a heifer."
                                            }
