                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f5096eb8-0f5a-47df-8481-bcecee76bc01",
                                                "sense_id": "fe58dcd0-fbf2-30cd-af49-8f410c63a42c",
                                                "text": "Some of the towne dwellers haue ſo large an opinion of their ſetled prouiſion, that if all her Maieſties fleet at once ſhould put into their bay, within twelue dayes warning with ſo much double beere, beefe, fiſh and bisket they would bulke them as they could wallow away with."
                                            }
